# The time service: authenticated time from NTS servers of three different operators
# (Cloudflare, Netnod, PTB – the list is built into /bin/timekeeper), agreed by at least two,
# given to the kernel (SYS_TIME_SET: the wall clock and the last known good time).
name     time
title    NTS time service
program  /bin/timekeeper
grant    net
grant    settime
grant    roots
tests    off
files    none
